  "checks": [
    "324 independent native-header UInt64/USize boundary cases; optimized route and canonical BigInt carrier asserted",
    "actual pinned extern rows and actual exported tail-recursive sum64/sumSize programs",
    "native Lean program outputs plus every small-fuel World prefix and saved siblings on mutable/eager/lazy backends against reference",
    "recognized wrapper guard failures preserve mutable exception payload and charged post-error state",
    "ordinary Long/BigInt fast carriers; BigInteger/native scalar and invalid/unbound values decline",
    "supported runtime/helper/reference/dispatch redefinitions before and after compilation decline safely",
    "malformed route table container does not execute user code in guard",
    "actual emitter/ABI reload plus owner generations invalidate old specialization",
    "consumer scalar namespace reloaded while foreign native classifier overridden cannot bless overridden dependency",
    "shared lazy cache separates default, descriptors and profile versions; eager reuse rejects same-body changed ABI",
    "forged Nat descriptor with publicly obtained tokens rejected by public compilation entry points",
    "bounded selected registry and invalid type/profile/index/extra-field descriptions rejected"
  ],
